                <li className="[-webkit-box-sizing:border-box] [-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased] [font-size:.9em] [line-height:1.5] [font-weight:400]">This framework first appeared, in a preliminary form, in my article “What Does ‘Product Quality’ Really Mean?” Sloan Management Review, Fall 1984.</li>
